Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Project initiation usually starts fragmented\NP M O Max brings it into one structured workspace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teams can paste, upload, load a complete demo\Nor begin from a guided blank start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,From raw project material, P M O Max produces\Na complete, editable project initiation document
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:24.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Project information and context are normalized\Nfor decision-ready review
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:30.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Objectives and key performance indicators stay\Nmeasurable, visible, and consistent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:36.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Scope, deliverables, constraints, and dependencies\Nremain explicit from the start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:42.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The entire initiation package stays aligned\Nin one shared system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:48.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Planning becomes executable when schedules turn\Ninto a live Gantt chart
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Milestones, sequencing, and delivery timing\Nbecome visible at a glance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:00.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Execution detail stays connected to the initiation\Ndocument that produced it
